# 살구 대화 에이전트(AI/chat_agent). deploy-agent.sh 가 __HOME__·__USER__ 를 바꿔 /etc/systemd/system 에 둬요.
# 127.0.0.1:8095 에서만 열려요(밖에서는 화면 서버 salgu-fe 를 거쳐서만 써요).
[Unit]
Description=Salgu chat agent (AI/chat_agent)
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=simple
WorkingDirectory=__HOME__/salgu-chat/current
ExecStart=__HOME__/salgu-chat/venv/bin/python run_server.py 8095
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=3
User=__USER__
NoNewPrivileges=true
PrivateTmp=true
ProtectSystem=strict
ReadWritePaths=__HOME__/salgu-chat/data
ProtectControlGroups=true
ProtectKernelModules=true
ProtectKernelTunables=true
RestrictSUIDSGID=true
LockPersonality=true

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
